| `layers.frontend.root` | string | `src/frontend` | a directory path | check_H | Moves where the stack directories are looked for. The static exporter checks every configured output against the project root before mutation and exits 14 if a path escapes through .. or a symlink. This is an export-time check; check_H does not enforce confinement. | the backend path: `layers.backend.path` | when `frontend_stack` is not `none` |
